            <div xml:id="m-4cf874c8-7908-42c4-b03d-07bfdadf7ec4">
              <lg xml:id="m-54cd7185-b3a5-4d4d-a248-e34f7cc7a9e7">
                <l xml:id="m-1b3499c7-f189-4610-872b-773ac3f85cfa" facs="#m-3c69a412-ff2d-4021-882f-f18a7ff7cc34" label="text-like">Mass to beg for Peace.</l><l xml:id="m-41065acf-b720-48ef-9781-b7385e0957b1" facs="#m-14edd286-bb69-4b87-9b26-a3f53339b00b" label="ambiguous">1287</l><l xml:id="m-6647ccba-1755-4ea2-be28-64a3c39c9860" facs="#m-773b7183-0056-4bd3-a5a6-6e57844275d5" label="ambiguous">it</l><l xml:id="m-c1118767-082b-4e6b-b6e6-1e2608413e60" facs="#m-7e221498-60d3-4a57-a713-0ba16fd5eed3" label="lyrics-like">fí¬</l><l xml:id="m-5be60717-6672-434e-9d6b-fee56e2c11f4" facs="#m-954245a1-60c0-45f6-8587-f95f39fa71a1" label="lyrics-like">os pá¬ cem, et ádi-pe fru¬</l><l xml:id="m-2262de18-76de-4ebb-8a55-8714b8a08659" facs="#m-1eb6323f-0531-4df7-81b1-fe5f8c3a12e1" label="lyrics-like">nes tú¬</l><l xml:id="m-19dfff6c-f0ac-4c19-b6dd-b67961ffd619" facs="#m-b2d6ba05-4964-4736-bbbc-6558c69b9a6a" label="ambiguous">ti</l><l xml:id="m-8264fa82-c5ba-4409-9642-a810318c6e21" facs="#m-30930084-f1db-4cb1-b1de-c167c6166edc" label="lyrics-like">mén¬</l><l xml:id="m-b5c56a17-cec3-4b5c-96a2-14516b6875b2" facs="#m-641051f0-bc2e-4292-9900-e58b676f51a5" label="lyrics-like">sá-ti¬ at</l><l xml:id="m-87381592-a702-42fd-a5ec-4fd697d45507" facs="#m-a9812a29-bb64-4b0e-b80d-24aaa5c608b4" label="ambiguous">te.</l><l xml:id="m-977abcee-255f-44f8-b40c-20250c9d2795" facs="#m-455404cc-803b-4de2-b51d-efcc08609285" label="ambiguous">4 Sequentia sancti Evangelii secundum Joannem. Joann. 20. c.</l><l xml:id="m-fd5578b7-dff5-42af-a680-349de5f80dc1" facs="#m-a44d1540-f1c3-4f62-94da-dbb8c1502297" label="lyrics-like">TN illo témpore: Cum sero esset puli, viso Dómino. Dixit ergo eis</l><l xml:id="m-e22a87ae-00aa-4c7f-bb09-e4f49b447e38" facs="#m-17c0affa-bbf2-4fca-afbd-d99b26abaee8" label="lyrics-like">Ldie illo, una sabbatórum, et fo¬</l><l xml:id="m-ef42d483-a03e-4cb9-91c1-190d46e59f43" facs="#m-d410fa36-5bca-4a84-93b2-596c0273e66b" label="ambiguous">iterum: Pax vobis. Sicut misit me</l><l xml:id="m-d22c028d-719c-4114-a93b-a79d236aa7a7" facs="#m-274ab193-d125-4f3d-9ba6-f004fe808459" label="ambiguous">Pater, et ego mitto vos. Haec cum</l><l xml:id="m-e17fa060-3dbe-4060-82a7-c60dface2185" facs="#m-54426553-27d6-4799-a756-96e0acd34fc1" label="lyrics-like">res essent clausae, ubi erant discí¬</l><l xml:id="m-95ac7e99-0a2f-4f85-9beb-9e777cf54bc6" facs="#m-e5441ae9-a3c1-408e-b6d6-d8c99193d8ef" label="lyrics-like">dixísset, insufflávit: et dixit eis</l><l xml:id="m-d9bee872-e62b-46f9-a636-1f38782c26a0" facs="#m-233236a7-d62d-4736-90c4-3509602d31f3" label="lyrics-like">puli congregáti propter metum Ju¬</l><l xml:id="m-b9ba318c-fca1-46b7-976f-eeafc688e765" facs="#m-0898d3f2-05b9-49b6-bb97-49c18dbfda00" label="lyrics-like">Accípite Spíritum sanctum: quo¬</l><l xml:id="m-2fb14b6d-87a5-4b05-8f2d-83c42402f463" facs="#m-b8fa214d-c928-438b-8f1e-434794cd512a" label="lyrics-like">daeórum: venit Jesus, et stetit in</l><l xml:id="m-1eef8547-1d44-4cf2-ad1a-58b5562ed5f6" facs="#m-79905284-34d8-44cb-a7f5-15eca70eefbf" label="lyrics-like">rum remiséritis peccáta, remittún¬</l><l xml:id="m-2e824083-1143-4500-adfa-5e657521cbdc" facs="#m-16815f2d-f659-4fb8-a75d-0032cebda8ee" label="lyrics-like">médio, et dixit eis: Pax vobis. Et</l><l xml:id="m-3e0f5693-310a-4b6c-9e86-272f55c1b0d5" facs="#m-6d181a88-5f7f-4a2b-ad7b-76fea9284241" label="lyrics-like">tur eis: et quorum retinuéritis, re¬</l><l xml:id="m-9cb5697c-147a-4170-a395-0056f36ee845" facs="#m-858918e0-b99c-4490-980d-e84c64f23dbd" label="lyrics-like">cum hoc dixísset, osténdit eis ma¬</l><l xml:id="m-7fb9160b-5fbe-45fc-b374-c3cf862f75fb" facs="#m-9d2f2c54-bd84-4e21-8747-95e5bab1e2ea" label="lyrics-like">nus, et latus. Gavísi sunt ergo discí¬ ténta sunt.</l><l xml:id="m-bd39431e-c9fb-4c47-a030-f18a05e8b728" facs="#m-6c19f105-3e25-402b-bf52-ec84d40cbd14" label="lyrics-like">Offertory. Laudáte Dóminum. p. 562. (T. P. Allelúia. p. 96).</l><l xml:id="m-39c02f11-bfa9-4b5e-9178-9632412c0724" facs="#m-b65e2f63-9445-4ba8-8cb6-36e344ccc1ea" label="ambiguous">Secret.</l><l xml:id="m-fd7318cf-924a-4027-ac13-c23c6d2fea8f" facs="#m-83ba67bb-957c-4f53-a490-1dfc3fdb96a4" label="lyrics-like">Eus, qui credéntes in te pópulos pietáte concéssa, Christianórum fi¬</l><l xml:id="m-03baf701-362b-4c42-acc2-be67e1f35ece" facs="#m-8a03c3fa-ab72-4eeb-8983-d83db8365028" label="lyrics-like">nes ab omni hoste fáciat esse secú¬</l><l xml:id="m-86031785-edff-44f7-8010-b378ffa0aae8" facs="#m-f72114b9-1658-4471-9a56-f4bd21d092fb" label="lyrics-like">I nullis sinis cóncuti terróribus:</l><l xml:id="m-3fcb7dad-06c8-485c-8e9b-aca3432f72b4" facs="#m-cbcd8a38-666f-4a1a-858e-1ead1dc51d4c" label="lyrics-like">dignáre preces et hóstias dicatae ros. Per Dóminum.</l><l xml:id="m-9ac1829c-24b4-4628-9786-1009e7592f7b" facs="#m-ea79dd2c-b86c-409d-9b88-860bb57026f0" label="lyrics-like">tibi plebis suscípere; ut pax a tua</l><l xml:id="m-63fb11d0-f873-45ba-998e-8a245dfdf6c3" facs="#m-36f5021a-9995-418e-9ebe-021be388f0ce" label="ambiguous">comm.—</l><l xml:id="m-d92aae16-28e4-474b-9ef7-e58be79b6cf1" facs="#m-57a6acf3-ed18-49eb-885c-95567aed39d9" label="ambiguous">5.</l><l xml:id="m-fb517c80-0ed1-4ecb-8110-e2fbacb408b6" facs="#m-ee47b26b-5d67-441b-ba68-3ef24e0b005c" label="lyrics-like">Acem re-línquo vó-bis: * pâ-cem mé-am do vó¬</l><l xml:id="m-bae41d44-f0df-459f-8571-69878b5001b3" facs="#m-332bd3f9-eccc-45a6-b084-aa8aa6de9732" label="lyrics-like">bis, dí-cit Dómi¬ nus. (T. P. Allelúia. P. 97.)</l><l xml:id="m-fa9b0f9a-e0f6-4ff2-bc60-57971af825ef" facs="#m-872ae65f-bb86-4cc7-a2a3-befc3c6d5205" label="ambiguous">Postcommunion.</l><l xml:id="m-bd5c5d6e-5b91-462a-97b8-4de439bf6995" facs="#m-6f7a89f4-4419-48b3-9e1c-e4e873d389af" label="lyrics-like">Eus, auctor pacis et amátor, qui in defensióne tua confidimus,</l><l xml:id="m-6f634c94-5ea0-4a2d-9c99-3bdf71c7c7af" facs="#m-09700fae-a8af-468f-95dd-928b2d1e345e" label="lyrics-like">U quem nosse, vivere, cui servire, ]nullius hostilitátis arma timeámus.</l><l xml:id="m-4de1ee57-6103-4ae6-8813-05628b781904" facs="#m-2e6c7633-d82f-4e9e-9e2d-5110eaaf4b31" label="lyrics-like">Per Dóminum.</l><l xml:id="m-0a12fe1a-9ac5-4092-bdf0-34f1ad7516bf" facs="#m-454fcd14-ddb1-4b1b-9a53-94a17c0900de" label="lyrics-like">regnáre est: prótege ab ómnibus</l><l xml:id="m-52c65deb-e9d4-467a-9f65-e9b330752696" facs="#m-0214f8cb-7a8b-427f-bd87-39789c7196f3" label="lyrics-like">impugnatiónibus súpplices tuos; ut!</l></lg>
            </div>
          </section>
        </score>
      </mdiv>
    </body>
  </music>
</mei>